{
  "name": "Computational Experiment",
  "abstract": "OGC API Records profile for describing a computational experiment realising a documented model. Wraps an OGC Open Science Application Package (CWL v1.2) and binds it to the documented model (an ODD record), the evidence equation (an `equation-property-relationship` record), and to standalone `experiment-input` / `experiment-output` records referenced by URI. Designed to be loadable by a CWL-aware engine (cwltool, calrissian, toil-cwl-runner) without further configuration.",
